      <activity id="c4f45acc-c1fd-55cb-9570-cd284c958d14" activityNameId="be15f7c0-d401-53af-ae8a-13012b47dc24" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, 2020, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, operation storage pumps, ENTSO, 2020, at plant
Technology shares determined based on data from ENTSO Transparency Platform. Both electricity production in Switzerland and electricity imports from neighbouring countries (Italy, France, Germany, Austria) are included.; UUID:729a0dd2-5a2b-3b5e-8960-df2240b7629f
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in Switzerland in 2018.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistics
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_729a0dd2-5a2b-3b5e-8960-df2240b7629f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
